    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95707" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάλαξ</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰκος</span>, ἡ</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπάλαξ</span>
